    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener>
                    <dateline><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1078" type="place">Glen Alpine</rs>, Lake
                        Tahoe, <date when="1946-08-20">Aug. 20<hi rend="sup">th</hi>,
                        1946</date>.</dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person"><rs
                                ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person"
                        >Friends</rs></rs>,</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>In writing this date, I remembered your birthday, <rs
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Paulus</rs> and send you all
                    good wishes from these mountains over Lake Tahoe, where we have a short
                    vacation. Do you know it? Where are you spending your vacation this year? Next
                    week we will meet <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__" type="person">Dorothee</rs>
                    with her husband in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__831" type="place">Carmel</rs>.
                    Wished you could come once again to the West.</p>
                <closer>
                    <salute>Good greetings</salute>
                    <signed>yours <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1213" type="person">L</rs>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
